     "explanation": "**Case averages** ($X$ is $0$ or $1$, so it is the share of the column in row $x=1$).",
     "latex": "\\begin{gathered}E[X\\mid Y=0]=\\frac{0.20}{0.30}=\\frac23,\\quad E[X\\mid Y=1]=\\frac{0.30}{0.45}=\\frac23 \\\\ E[X\\mid Y=2]=\\frac{0.20}{0.25}=0.8\\end{gathered}"
    },
    {
     "explanation": "**Weight** by $p_Y=0.30,\\ 0.45,\\ 0.25$.",
     "latex": "E[X]=\\frac23(0.30)+\\frac23(0.45)+0.8(0.25)=0.2+0.3+0.2=0.7"
    },
    {
     "explanation": "**Check:** $E[X]=0\\cdot0.30+1\\cdot0.70=0.7\\ \\checkmark$",
     "latex": ""
    }
   ],
   "answer": "$0.7$",
