   "difficulty": "intermediate",
   "origin": "source",
   "prompt": "Two fair dice. $X$ = first die, $Y$ = sum.\n\n**(a)** Find $p_{X|Y}(x\\mid4)$. (3 marks)\n\n**(b)** Find $F_{X|Y}(x\\mid4)$. (3 marks)\n\n**(c)** Find $E[X\\mid Y=4]$. (2 marks)\n\n**(d)** Use (a) to show $X$ and $Y$ are not independent. (2 marks)",
   "solution": "",
   "steps": [
    {
     "explanation": "(a) **Sum 4:** $(1,3),(2,2),(3,1)$. Each $x$ once.",
