    },
    {
     "explanation": "(b) **Add up.**",
     "latex": "F_{X|Y}(x\\mid4)=\\begin{cases}0,&x<1\\\\ \\frac13,&1\\le x<2\\\\ \\frac23,&2\\le x<3\\\\ 1,&x\\ge3\\end{cases}"
    },
    {
     "explanation": "(c) **Mean.**",
     "latex": "E[X\\mid Y=4]=\\frac{1+2+3}{3}=2"
    },
    {
     "explanation": "(d) **Compare:** $p_{X|Y}(4\\mid4)=0$ but $p_X(4)=\\tfrac16$. Not equal → dependent.",
     "latex": ""
    }
   ],
   "answer": "**(a)** $\\tfrac13$ at $1,2,3$\n\n**(b)** $0,\\tfrac13,\\tfrac23,1$\n\n**(c)** $2$\n\n**(d)** $0\\ne\\tfrac16$",
