     "explanation": "(b) **Mean, square, subtract.**",
     "latex": "\\begin{gathered}E[X\\mid Y=1]=\\frac{2+4+6}{3}=4 \\\\ E[X^2\\mid Y=1]=\\frac{4+16+36}{3}=\\frac{56}3 \\\\ \\operatorname{Var}(X\\mid Y=1)=\\frac{56}3-16=\\frac83\\end{gathered}"
